```
function artRank(id, s=state) { return s.activeArts?.includes(id) ? clamp(Number(s.artRanks?.[id])||1,1,5) : 0; }
function artDamageMult(id, s=state) { const r=artRank(id,s); return 1 + Math.max(0,r-1)*.18; }
```
Add after critChance.

